# Ultra Apple Reminders

macOS Reminders integration.

## When to Use
 "Remind me to...", "Add reminder", "What\'s on my list?"

## Commands

```bash
# Create reminder
osascript -e 'tell application "Reminders" to make new reminder with properties {name:"Buy groceries", due date:date "2025-01-15"}'

# List reminders
osascript -e 'tell application "Reminders" to get name of every reminder whose completed is false'

# Complete reminder
osascript -e 'tell application "Reminders" to set completed of reminder "Buy groceries" to true'

# List all lists
osascript -e 'tell application "Reminders" to get name of every list'
```
